      "source": "urn:doxa:source-version:c12375f4bcfaa070cb7326b6b284014ace360628d6cbef690dbb84eada9dc340",
      "exact": "The hearing record contains a traffic plan that already routes ambulances around Civic Square. The file contains no analysis of whether that plan fails on demonstration nights.",
